Scoped GENeric Header (GENH) demuxer

The GENH magic and channel probe, the 60-byte header walk with its int casts
and refusal order, the codec switch, the start_offset and header_size rules
and the block_align packets in src/genh.ts follow libavformat/genh.c
(genh_probe, genh_read_header, genh_read_packet); the short final packet
semantics follow libavformat/utils.c (av_get_packet).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
